{
  "_comment": [
    "NCF-3 §1.9 — EVM wallets (added 2026-09-23). Written by web/scripts/gen-evm-vectors.mjs with",
    "@noble/hashes (HKDF-Expand, Keccak-256) and @noble/curves (mapHashToField, getPublicKey); every",
    "address is checked a second time against viem's privateKeyToAddress. The Rust crate and the",
    "browser engine are both held to this file and neither wrote it.",
    "evmSeed(N) = HKDF-Expand(walletRoot, 'nmts/v3/evm-wallet/' || dec(N), 48)",
    "evmKey(N)  = (OS2IP(evmSeed(N)) mod (n - 1)) + 1, n = the secp256k1 order",
    "evmAddr(N) = keccak256(X || Y)[12..32], written EIP-55",
    "wallet_root_hex comes from ncf3.json (kdf[].wallet_root_hex), so this file continues that chain."
  ],
